<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Micor half yr shr up on tourism venture.</title>
<headline>Micor half yr shr up on tourism venture.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     20.0	  vs 13.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   5.34	  vs 3.48</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   4.20	  vs 4.87</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.20	  vs 1.36</p>
<p>    Turnover		  361.94	vs 427.42</p>
<p>Full name: Micor Industrial Corp Ltd</p>
<p>Tourvest profits equity accounted</p>
<p>				  2.36	  vs none</p>
<p>NOTE - Shareholders were reminded to a February 10 announcement relating to the disposal of the group's travel businesses in exchange for a 34.5 percent stake in Tourism Investment Corp Ltd (Tourvest).</p>
<p>Directors said given no major disruption to trading conditions it was anticipated that the group should achieve an improvement in results for the second half of the financial year over those of last year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
